This is actually a pretty substantial idea, so it would be fairly
complicated to implement.  Basically, the idea is to add a new form of
rewards for the player's actions, kind of like intrinsics, but these
rewards would have very specific requirements.  Some of the rewards
would only be possible if some of the more fatal species of monsters
weren't genocided, so this would be an incentive to stop genociding
all of the tough monsters because you'd be missing out.  Here are some
suggestions ...

There'd be some meta-command, like #feats, that would show you which
you have accomplished.

The feats will be listing in this format
Name: The name of the feat
Reqs: The requirements to accomplish it
Rews: Your reward for completing this feat

Name: Stone Eater
Reqs: Eat a footrice corpse (and survive).
Rews: You have a smaller chance of falling victim to a stoning attack.

Name: Optometrist
Reqs: Kill 10 floating eyes.
Rews: You can see better.  A small increase to the chance of
successfully reading spellbooks.

Name: Nymphslayer
Reqs: Kill a total of 20 nymphs (any species).
Rews: When a nymph steals money from you, there is a chance that you
grab onto it and prevent him from teleporting away with your money.

Name: Leprechaunslayer
Reqs: Kill a total of 10+20X leprechauns, where X is the number of
leprechaun halls encountered in your game so far.
Rews: When a leprechaun steals money from you, there is a chance that
you grab onto him and prevent him from teleporting away with your
money.

Name: Mind Saver
Reqs: Kill 10 mind flayers.
Rews: Adds 1 to intelligence, adds a small chance that any effect that
would lower or abuse your intelligence fails (including mind flayer
attacks).

Name: Master Mind Saver
Reqs: Kill 10 master mind flayers.
Rews: Adds 2 to intelligence, adds a chance that any effect that would
lower or abuse your intelligence fails (including mind flayer
attacks).

Name: Mastermind Player
Reqs: Enter the Castle by playing the game of Mastermind.
Rews: A significant chance of adding 1 to wisdom or intelligence.

Name: Stonekiller
Reqs: Kill 50 monsters with a wielded footrice corpse.
Rews: Adds a bonus to attacks with a wielded footrice corpse.

Name: Regicider
Reqs: Kill a total of 20 leaders, e.g. gnome kings, orc lords,
lieutenants.
Rews: Leaders become afraid of you and have a small chance of fleeing
rather than attacking.

Name: Jeweler
Reqs: Identify 50% of all gems.
Rews: Randomly identifies two unidentified gems.

Name: Master Jeweler
Reqs: Identify all gems.
Rews: {Anyone got any ideas?}

Name: Dragoneater
Reqs: Eat 20 dragon (not baby dragon) corpses.
Rews: Gain a random dragon intrinsic.

Name: Fire Eater
Reqs: Eat anything that is on fire, e.g. lit candle, lamp, etc.
Rews: {Anyone got any ideas?}

Name: Entomologist
